  "question": {
    "text": "If the area of the region bounded by the curves&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>, then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo></math>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "36",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p>Equations of curve&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Now solving above equations we get,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>Now plotting the area we get,&nbsp;</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/f1f35d8f-b7ef-4c4c-877a-04c4b4701de3-b15b6a74-f8e7-4f5c-8b6b-d50f2c5801e1-24-01-2023.png\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 219px;\" /></p><p>Now from above diagram required area will be</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>0</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>27</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>27</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>27</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;sq. units</p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn></math>.</p>",
